==Trivia==
This card is one of several featured in the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion's "Manaphy Travelogue" [[Space-Time Smackdown (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], all of which feature {{p|Manaphy}} in their standard prints' artwork. A {{p|Lumineon}} is also featured in the illustration rare print of {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Manaphy|162}} from the same expansion.

===Origin===
*{{m|Waterfall}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Lumineon}} can learn via [[TM]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

